### ===================================================================
### Practical 6: Full Stack Integration API Test Suite (.http)
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ===================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Server Health, Database & CORS Info (GET /)
GET {{baseUrl}}/
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Fetch All Tasks for React Frontend (GET /tasks)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Filter Tasks by Completion Status (GET /tasks?completed=true)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks?completed=true
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create Task with Validation (POST /tasks) - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Build Full Stack React + Node + MongoDB App",
  "description": "Practical 6 end-to-end integration and state synchronization",
  "completed": false
}

###

### 5. Validation Error Rejection (POST /tasks without title) - 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Missing title triggers structured 400 validation error in React toast."
}

###

### 6. Read Single Task Document by MongoDB ObjectId (Replace with live _id)
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Update Task Status & Content (PUT /tasks/:id) - 200 OK
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "completed": true,
  "description": "Updated and synchronized with React frontend state"
}

###

### 8. Delete Task with Full-Stack Confirmation (DELETE /tasks/:id) - 200 OK
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/66b9f35e98f01a5b82c7a123
Accept: application/json

###

### 9. CastError Format Checking (GET /tasks/invalid-id) - 400 Bad Request
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/invalid-object-id-format
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Test 404 Route - 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/non-existent-route
Accept: application/json

###

### 11. Test Global Error Handler Simulation (GET /error-test) - 500 Server Error
GET {{baseUrl}}/error-test
Accept: application/json
